305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Hospital Management System \(HMS\) was successfully developed to organize and automate hospital operations such as patient records, staff roles, appointments, visits, billing, and lab activities. The system ensures data accuracy, security, and role-based access, allowing each staff member to perform only their specific duties. The inclusion of a Doctor Efficiency module makes this project unique by enabling hospitals to assess doctor performance using feedback and activity data. Overall, it provides a reliable, scalable, and well-structured database solution for efficient healthcare management.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
