/T (Future Scope)
/E (Future Scope)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
307 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In the future, this system can be enhanced by integrating a web or mobile interface for real-time access, implementing AI-based analytics for predicting workloads, and adding automated notifications for patients. It can also be extended with EHR support and data dashboards to offer deeper insights and improve hospital decision-making.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
